<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh May forex reserves down at $1.6 bln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh May forex reserves down at $1.6 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange reserves fell to $1.6 billion at the end of May from $1.86 billion in April, central bank officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reserves were $1.96 billion in May, 1996.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves (month):</p>
<p>(in billions of dollars)</p>
<p>    May		April	   May 96</p>
<p>    $1.6	     $1.86	   $1.96</p>
</text>
